WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.769
-Hi, everybody.
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.103
Thank you so much for tuning in.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.238
I'm Jimmy Fallon, and this is
the Roots right there.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.040
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.475
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:10.876
Well, guys, this is exciting.

00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:13.879
Tonight the 2020 NFL season
kicked off.

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:16.015
That's right. Football is back.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:19.519
Finally an excuse to drink booze
and watch hours of TV.

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.953
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:22.122
That's right.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:24.190
It's football season,
and I'll be honest.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.493
When I saw two guys tackle each
other and make physical contact,

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:28.895
I got a little choked up.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.463
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:32.065
It's been so long.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.766
That's right.
After the first tackle,

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:34.967
the running back didn't get up.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.270
He was just like,
"It feels so good to be held."

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.071
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:41.274
Tonight we got to see
Kansas City star quarterback

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:42.742
Patrick Mahomes.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.477
Not only is Mahomes
the reigning Super Bowl MVP,

00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:46.912
he also is
the last person to yell,

00:00:46.912 --> 00:00:49.182
"I'm going to Disney World,"
without a hint of fear.

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:51.116
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.116 --> 00:00:53.286
That's right. It's a good time
to be Patrick Mahomes.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:58.558
This summer he signed a 10-year,
$503 million contract.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.226
When the team owner
congratulated him,

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.295
Mahomes was like,
"Actually I'm the owner now."

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.729
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:05.665
$503 million.

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:07.500
Patrick Mahomes is so rich,

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.669
he actually bought "Mulan"
on Disney+.

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:14.040
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.575
Meanwhile, Houston's
quarterback, Deshaun Watson,

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:21.548
just signed his own new contract
for four years and $160 million.

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.117
When he heard that, Mahomes
was like, "Aww, that's cute."

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:26.352
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:29.289
To keep everyone safe,
the Chiefs had just 16,000 fans

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:32.392
at tonight's game instead of
their usual 76,000.

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:34.294
It wasn't hard
to narrow it down.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:36.296
They just advertised it
as a Bengals game.

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:40.333
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.502
And get this --
Now all the coaches have to

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.136
wear masks on the sidelines.

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:45.504
You see that? Yeah.

00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:47.173
The season just won't be
the same without seeing

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.841
Bill Belichick's
shimmering smile.

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:52.145
I'm just -- I just --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:54.580
Of course, another big story
this off-season was

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.383
that Tom Brady joined
the Tampa Bay Buccaneers.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.552
This is Brady's 21st season.

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.187
21, yeah.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.355
He's outlasted
Peyton Manning, Tony Romo,

00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:04.991
and "Keeping Up with
the Kardashians."

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.826
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.461
That's right. Tom Brady went
from New England to Florida.

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:12.064
Before, his fans pregamed
with Boston lager.

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:13.967
Now they do it with bath salts.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:16.936
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.004
And this is fun.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.972
Rob Gronkowski
came out of retirement

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:21.908
to play with Brady
and Tampa Bay.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.643
It wasn't a tough decision.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.778
Once every Señor Frog's on Earth
shut down,

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.046
Gronk had nowhere else to go.

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.481
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.084
Well, guys, everyone is still
talking about Bob Woodward's

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:33.619
tapes of his conversations
with President Trump.

00:02:33.619 --> 00:02:36.322
Yesterday, Trump was asked about
downplaying the virus,

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.657
and here's what he had to say.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.706
Yeah, Trump is a cheerleader
for our country.

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:55.241
Then he proved it by leading

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.809
a fun call and response
with the press.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.210
He was like, "What do we need?"

00:02:58.210 --> 00:02:59.578
The press was like, "A plan!"

00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:00.680
He was like,
"When do we need it?"

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:01.881
"Six months ago!"

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:03.783
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:05.685
Yeah, he's a cheerleader
for our country.

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:07.253
Check out his pom-poms.

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:13.125
Look just like the virus.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:16.262
Last night Trump complained
about the fallout on Twitter

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.864
and described it
as "the political hit job

00:03:18.864 --> 00:03:22.501
by rapidly fading Bob Woodward
and his boring book."

00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:24.436
Trump was like, "Total hit job.

00:03:24.436 --> 00:03:26.705
I spoke to a reporter 18 times,

00:03:26.705 --> 00:03:29.642
and he recorded it and wrote
down my exact words. Fake."

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:32.511
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.511 --> 00:03:34.480
Well, let's get to
some business news here.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.815
I saw that Home Depot just made
an interesting announcement.

00:03:36.815 --> 00:03:38.084
Listen to this.

00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:40.119
-So, Home Depot says
they're officially canceling

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:43.356
that traditional rush out
to the store Black Friday.

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:45.057
They'll be offering discounts,
though,

00:03:45.057 --> 00:03:48.828
through November and December
at stores and online.

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.497
-Hang on.

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:54.400
Were people really going to
Home Depot on Black Friday?

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.801 --> 00:03:57.503
People were setting their alarm
at 2:00 a.m.

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:59.405
and lining up outside
for plywood?

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:01.173
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.173 --> 00:04:04.344
"That's all my kid wants.
That's all he wants."

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:06.846
Meanwhile, T.J. Maxx will
continue their tradition

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:08.681
of every day
being like Black Friday.

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:11.050
"Give me that sweatshirt!
Give me that!

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.852
Throw it over here!"

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:17.190
Guys, as CBD continues
to become more and more popular,

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.525
an unlikely celebrity
has launched her own line.

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:20.793
Watch this.

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.261
-Hi, everyone.
I'm Martha Stewart,

00:04:22.261 --> 00:04:24.396
and I have
some very exciting news.

00:04:24.396 --> 00:04:28.101
I am launching a new line
of CBD products.

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.568
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.568 --> 00:04:30.737
-That's right.

00:04:30.737 --> 00:04:33.606
Martha Stewart is launching
her own CBD line.

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:35.875
Even crazier, Snoop Dogg
is launching his own line

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:37.543
of tablecloths and pie tins.

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:41.881
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:43.949
Well, here's something
we could all use.

00:04:43.949 --> 00:04:46.686
The boxed-wine company Franzia
is now selling

00:04:46.686 --> 00:04:48.554
a wine-dispensing backpack.

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:49.888
Look at this thing.

00:04:49.888 --> 00:04:51.824
Yeah!
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:53.993
Maybe it's just me,
but I'm waiting for something

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:56.963
a little more professional, like
a whiskey-dispensing briefcase.

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:58.064
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.064 --> 00:04:59.798
I'm pretty sure
that's the first backpack

00:04:59.798 --> 00:05:01.501
that's for teachers,
not students.

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.902
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:05.571
Some entertainment news --
during the coronavirus --

00:05:05.571 --> 00:05:07.806
due to the coronavirus,
soap opera actors

00:05:07.806 --> 00:05:10.810
are doing kissing scenes
but with mannequins.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.678
[ Laughter ]
-No.

00:05:12.678 --> 00:05:14.647
-It's a little distracting.
Watch this.

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:22.622 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:32.632
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:35.000
-No! What?!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.669
-Yeah, man. That's right.

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:39.605
After one kiss, another
mannequin rolled in and said,

00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:41.340
"Rodrigo, how could you?
That's my twin."

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.775
[ Laughter ]

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:44.009
Well, this is crazy.

00:05:44.009 --> 00:05:46.345
A family of a missing hiker
in England

00:05:46.345 --> 00:05:49.048
got a pretty great surprise
this week. Check this out.

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:51.783
-An 80-year-old Englishman
who went missing during a hike

00:05:51.783 --> 00:05:54.853
was found safe after he walked
in on the news conference

00:05:54.853 --> 00:05:56.722
his family set up
to try and find him.

00:05:56.722 --> 00:06:02.795
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.795 --> 00:06:05.465
-Meanwhile, his wife
folded the insurance paperwork

00:06:05.465 --> 00:06:07.500
and was like,
"Oh, good, he's back.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.403
Thank -- Thank God.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.839
Yeah, authorities were relieved,
while Democrats were like,

00:06:12.839 --> 00:06:14.507
"Mr. Biden, where the hell
have you been?"

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:16.075
[ Laughter ]

00:06:16.075 --> 00:06:17.676
And finally this is going viral.

00:06:17.676 --> 00:06:19.011
Last night in Tennessee

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:21.313
there was a pretty interesting
sighting. Watch this.

00:06:21.313 --> 00:06:24.883
-There is a search under way
for a tiger in Knox County.

00:06:24.883 --> 00:06:26.385
According to
the sheriff's office,

00:06:26.385 --> 00:06:30.423
the deputy spotted the tiger in
an industrial park last night.

00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:32.324
No other sightings
have been reported.

00:06:32.324 --> 00:06:35.061
-Even crazier, today the tiger
showed up at a press conference

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:37.029
about his disappearance.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:38.630
If you see the tiger,
be careful.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.599
It's considered especially
dangerous ever since

00:06:40.599 --> 00:06:42.902
it got a hold of one of
those Franzia backpacks.

